<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified artillery shelling of southern Lebanese towns, including a reported strike on a town and an explosion in Bani Hayyan, while Israeli drones have followed a woman entering a home in south Lebanon. Hezbollah has responded with artillery fire on Israeli positions and has begun distributing its first cash payments to war victims and displaced families. The United Nations reports 300,000 people displaced in Lebanon due to the fighting. These aid payments and the drone surveillance of civilians are new developments compared with the earlier brief on airstrikes and displacement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168713&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOVjF2T2lxNDM2ZFQ1cnBQMUQ5Um0xMEp5SlNodFhmQVk4QnczWUFqQjlGSnFjdlp2cTdhV3lfV2pkdHFESUJxQkZLcWpQYi01RTkzbm5Zd2c0ZzV3eVdIeElWWFVkbV9IY2RLckVmVHUyZW5PY1B3MVZhVHlfYzF2VWVUaXc1LVdsQTB1c2Y5dEp1Rjd6VjJQSi1tZmpmV0xsR2FENlU0aktPM1BNTEZSTFp0aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNUlhDU2RpTmdNaVhURVFMQk8xaEswLUR0VzVGN0FGTEZHbXI1Z2s2T3dpUThlY3lndVNHYWRBZkFPWERqN3MyUUM4OTJUY0RIaGt0czFGellBUVpDVnRnYlYtVG9NenBsMEJYZ0ZQc0pxR1hNMUx1ME00NUk3SUtCaVRMeTNuSDVjT21UWGJqaGRBNks2MVJHYlJ6QVhKOFVrcml4Y21QZE1SUlAyaVAxTFo1a3AtUFNoNlpwUDRR0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1SWENTZGlOZ01pWFRFUUxCTzFoSzAtRHRXNUY3QUZMRkdtcjVnazZPd2lROGVjeWd1U0dhZEFmQU9YRGo3czJRQzg5MlRjREhoa3RzMUZ6WUFRWkNWdGdiVi1Ub016cGwwQlhnRlBzSnFHWE0xTHUwTTQ1STdJS0JpVEx5M25INWNPbVRYYmpoZEE2SzYxUkdiUnpBWEo4VWtyaXhjbVBkTVJSUDJpUDFMWjVrcC1QU2g2WnBQNFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxON2Z1M0U5RTRJUzB5M2N5bV9HWUVfaUJJdF9qUDRkQm8xTDJBVjdBN1NFY1c2VV9KczFKX2luUDZDcDNUSWg5SUNUdW43WGhJbEhtSFVibkZIMGc4aG5rc